  <description>Competition course environment for RobotX 2026 at Singapore River, Marina Bay. Includes terrain mesh, jetty (8 wooden piers with collision), drone landing platform, and 200m x 200m boundary walls. Visual-only water surface uses the Fuel "Coast Water" model (not bundled). Origin at Marina Bay coordinates.</description>
</model>
